{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f  Chaotic Party Arr-cade Action for up to 12 players</strong>\u00a0<strong>\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Join two rival crews of up to 6 mates as you battle for supremacy on the high seas. Play locally or online, where teams try to steal treasure, defeat enemy captains, or sink ships to win matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our <strong>FREE DEMO\u00a0</strong>offers online matches (including crossplay) and the first 10 levels of the campaign.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Chaos.png?t=1741477315\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Victory_Types.gif?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by classic SNES games and modern couch co-op games, Plunder Panic blends retro graphics, arcade action, team-based strategy, and a boatload of  modify-arrs to keep even the crankiest pirates happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/12_playeers.png?t=1741477315\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/12_Players.gif?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plunder Panic supports flexible team configurations with local, online, and AI-controlled players, making it perfect for casual parties and competitive play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Campaign.png?t=1741477315\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Campaign.gif?t=1741477315\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the treacherous, pirate-infested waters in campaign mode! Complete unique objectives across each island, unlocking new items, levels, and modify-arrs along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Levels.png?t=1741477315\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Stage_Highlights.gif?t=1741477315\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring 18 unique stages, each with dynamic, gameplay-altering effects! Dodge axe-throwing shopkeepers, spear-shooting Vikings, and even a ship-snapping kraken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Modifiers.png?t=1741477315\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Items.gif?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Modifyarrs.gif?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Levels.gif?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to add more panic? We have boatloads of game modes, items, and modify-arrs to play with. There are endless combinations to explore on our high seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Cross_Platform.png?t=1741477315\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Replayability.gif?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Ship_Goofin.gif?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have a crew on another platform? No problem! Plunder Panic features\u00a0<strong>crossplay</strong>\u00a0support across 10+ platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Dangerous.png?t=1741477315\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Replayability.gif?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aspire to be the top pirate in the world? Swashbuckle the competition in ranked online matches! Or prefer to conquer yer couch? Retro-inspired player awards and stats keep you earning plunder to increase your sharable bounty poster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Treasure.png?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our coffers are starting to grow with indie acclaim!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">IndieCade Audience Choice Award, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PAX Rising Showcase winner, Official selection of the Indie MEGABOOTH </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featured at SXSW, PAX East, PAX West, and PAX Rising Online</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2300360?t=1741477315","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2300360?t=1741477315","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/2b268dadd7e814dea44c4e872eda7d81c0a94eac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741477315","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/2b268dadd7e814dea44c4e872eda7d81c0a94eac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741477315","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f  Chaotic Party Arr-cade Action for up to 12 players</strong>\u00a0<strong>\ud83c\udff4\u200d\u2620\ufe0f</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Join two rival crews of up to 6 mates as you battle for supremacy on the high seas. Play locally or online, where teams try to steal treasure, defeat enemy captains, or sink ships to win matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our <strong>FREE DEMO\u00a0</strong>offers online matches (including crossplay) and the first 10 levels of the campaign.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Chaos.png?t=1741477315\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Victory_Types.gif?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by classic SNES games and modern couch co-op games, Plunder Panic blends retro graphics, arcade action, team-based strategy, and a boatload of  modify-arrs to keep even the crankiest pirates happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/12_playeers.png?t=1741477315\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/12_Players.gif?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plunder Panic supports flexible team configurations with local, online, and AI-controlled players, making it perfect for casual parties and competitive play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Campaign.png?t=1741477315\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Campaign.gif?t=1741477315\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the treacherous, pirate-infested waters in campaign mode! Complete unique objectives across each island, unlocking new items, levels, and modify-arrs along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Levels.png?t=1741477315\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Stage_Highlights.gif?t=1741477315\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring 18 unique stages, each with dynamic, gameplay-altering effects! Dodge axe-throwing shopkeepers, spear-shooting Vikings, and even a ship-snapping kraken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Modifiers.png?t=1741477315\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Items.gif?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Modifyarrs.gif?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Levels.gif?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to add more panic? We have boatloads of game modes, items, and modify-arrs to play with. There are endless combinations to explore on our high seas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Cross_Platform.png?t=1741477315\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Replayability.gif?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Ship_Goofin.gif?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have a crew on another platform? No problem! Plunder Panic features\u00a0<strong>crossplay</strong>\u00a0support across 10+ platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Dangerous.png?t=1741477315\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Replayability.gif?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aspire to be the top pirate in the world? Swashbuckle the competition in ranked online matches! Or prefer to conquer yer couch? Retro-inspired player awards and stats keep you earning plunder to increase your sharable bounty poster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/extras/Treasure.png?t=1741477315\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Our coffers are starting to grow with indie acclaim!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">IndieCade Audience Choice Award, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PAX Rising Showcase winner, Official selection of the Indie MEGABOOTH </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featured at SXSW, PAX East, PAX West, and PAX Rising Online</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","developers":["Will Winn Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1455900","name":"Plunder Panic"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/header.jpg?t=1741477315","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2024 Will Winn Games, Inc.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet 