{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/ss_0ecae0cbe6b2726406148655adc267fa5befa871.1920x1080.jpg?t=1741477315","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2300360/ss_0ecae0cbe6b2726406148655adc267fa5befa871.600x338.jpg?t=1741477315"}],"short_description":"Chaotic Party Arr-cade Action for up to 12 players! Be the first to plunder all the treasure, sink the enemy ship, or defeat their captain. This demo includes the first 10 stages of the single-player campaign and limited online play (w/ crossplay).","steam_appid":2300360,"support_info":{"email":"community@willwinn.games","url":"https://willwinn.games/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"demo","website":"https://plunderpanic.com"}